guide forever/reputation/darnassus
title Darnassus Reputation
category Reputation
faction Alliance
levels 12-60
zone Darnassus
# Built from the Era-baseline reference data: Raedon Duskstriker, the Darnassus
# cloth quartermaster, and the cloth quests 7792/7798/7799/7800 (one-time) and 7801
# (Additional Runecloth, repeatable) from quests.json; cloth farm spots are
# the densest spawn clusters of strong cloth droppers in items.json/npcs.json.
# Nothing public shows Forever changing the cloth donations; this has NOT been
# play-tested on Forever yet. Refine it with Polestar_Recorder sessions.
#
# The client never flags a repeatable quest as completed, so the Additional
# Runecloth steps finish on the Darnassus standing (rep 69); each
# step's optional `turnin 7801 direct` checks off at its first hand-in. Cloth counts (60 per first donation, 20 per repeat) are game
# knowledge: the data only has the 60 Runecloth of A Donation of Runecloth.

step Raedon Duskstriker: A Donation of Wool
  tip Raedon Duskstriker takes cloth for Darnassus in Darnassus. The first donations of Wool, Silk, Mageweave and Runecloth (60 cloth each) are done once and give the most reputation per cloth; after them, Additional Runecloth repeats until Exalted. Exalted with another race's city lets you buy that race's mounts. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains.
  level 12
  accept 7792

step Wool Cloth
  zone Westfall
  tip Riverpaw Bandits and Taskmasters (level 16-18) drop it here. The Auction House works too.
  collect 2592 x60 quest 7792.1 @59.9,70.7

step Raedon Duskstriker: A Donation of Silk
  zone Darnassus
  turnin 7792
  level 26
  accept 7798

step Silk Cloth
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Syndicate Mercenaries at Stromgarde (level 31-32) drop it here. The Auction House works too.
  collect 4306 x60 quest 7798.1 @32.3,28.3

step Raedon Duskstriker: A Donation of Mageweave
  zone Darnassus
  turnin 7798
  level 40
  accept 7799

step Mageweave Cloth
  zone Tanaris
  tip Dunemaul ogres (level 45-48) drop it here. The Auction House works too.
  collect 4338 x60 quest 7799.1 @40.1,54.4

step Raedon Duskstriker: A Donation of Runecloth
  zone Darnassus
  turnin 7799
  level 50
  accept 7800

step Runecloth
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) drop it here; every Scourge kill here also counts toward the Argent Dawn (see that guide). The Auction House works too.
  collect 14047 x60 quest 7800.1 @40,51.3

step Raedon Duskstriker: Runecloth delivered
  zone Darnassus
  turnin 7800

step Additional Runecloth to Honored
  tip Additional Runecloth takes 20 Runecloth per turn-in and repeats as often as you like. Bring Runecloth in multiples of 20 and hand them all in at once, one turn-in after another. Runecloth: Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) in Eastern Plaguelands, or the Auction House.
  collect 14047 x20 optional @40,51.3 map 1423
  turnin 7801 direct optional
  rep 69 Honored

step Additional Runecloth to Revered
  tip Keep handing in Additional Runecloth, 20 Runecloth at a time. Runecloth: Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) in Eastern Plaguelands, or the Auction House.
  collect 14047 x20 optional @40,51.3 map 1423
  turnin 7801 direct optional
  rep 69 Revered

step Additional Runecloth to Exalted
  tip Keep handing in Additional Runecloth until Darnassus is Exalted. Runecloth: Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) in Eastern Plaguelands, or the Auction House.
  collect 14047 x20 optional @40,51.3 map 1423
  turnin 7801 direct optional
  rep 69 Exalted
